bHKjLcV5F"}, {"id": "ad8af934-74bc-4a42-aebc-8f11d289ebc5", "role": "assistant", "content": "**Observed:**\nThe cohort is now Race: black or african american, with 334 cases. The cohort change still applies.\nThe OncoMatrix covers 334 cases and 287 samples with mutation data. The most frequently mutated genes are:\n- KRAS (148)\n- NRAS (113)\n- DIS3 (98)\n- BRAF (76)\n- MYC (62)\n- TP53 (38)\n\n**Limits:**\nThe data is synthetic and has no clinical meaning. Numbers are for the default view and don't reflect changes made in the chart. The counts are per case mutation totals in the OncoMatrix summary, and the 334 cases are not the same as the 287 samples with mutation data."}]}

